@startuml
title Deployment Diagram - Parallel Search System

skinparam shadowing false
skinparam componentStyle rectangle

node "Client Device" {
  artifact "Web Browser" as Browser
  artifact "CLI Application" as CLI
}

node "Docker Host" {

  node "Docker Compose" {

    node "Search Server Container" {
      component "Java Backend" as Backend
      component "REST API" as REST
      component "WebSocket Server" as WS
      component "Thread Pool" as Pool
      database "Inverted Index\n(In Memory)" as Index
    }

    node "Ollama Container" {
      component "Ollama Service" as Ollama
      artifact "Local LLM Model" as Model
    }

  }

  folder "Text Dataset" as Dataset
}

Browser --> REST : HTTP / JSON
CLI --> REST : HTTP / JSON
Browser --> WS : WebSocket
CLI --> WS : WebSocket

REST --> Backend
WS --> Backend

Backend --> Pool : Parallel indexing
Pool --> Index : Thread-safe updates
Backend --> Index : Keyword search
Backend --> Ollama : HTTP /api/generate
Ollama --> Model : Inference

Dataset --> Backend : Read documents
@enduml